## API Contract

### Inbound (from client)

POST /api/v1/export
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileType": "PDF",                     // XLSX | PPTX | PDF
  "rowIds": ["row-101", "row-102"],      // max 1000
  "columns": ["topic", "owner", "status"]
}

Response: binary file stream with correct Content-Type and Content-Disposition headers

### Outbound to meeting-planner

POST http://meeting-planner/internal/generate/excel
POST http://meeting-planner/internal/generate/pptx
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Service: cohub-agenda-builder

Body:
{
  "sheetTitle": "Monthly Agenda",
  "columns": [
    { "header": "Topic", "key": "topic" }
  ],
  "rows": [
    { "topic": "Q2 Review", "owner": "Rishabh" }
  ]
}

Response: application/octet-stream (raw bytes)

### Outbound to content-creator (PDF only)

POST http://content-creator/internal/convert/pptx-to-pdf
Content-Type: application/octet-stream
X-Internal-Service: cohub-agenda-builder

Body: raw pptx bytes

Response: application/octet-stream (raw pdf bytes)

