## Class Responsibilities

- ExportController: thin, delegates to ExportOrchestrator, sets response headers
- ExportOrchestrator: owns full flow — calls AgendaExportService → ColumnMapper → FileGenerationClient → streams response
- AgendaExportService: fetches CohubAgenda entities by rowIds from JPA repository, maps each to Map<String, Object> with all available fields as keys. Stub with dummy data for now.
- ColumnMapper: trims each row map to only requested column keys, fills empty string for missing keys
- ExportMetadataBuilder: builds fileName, sheetTitle, contentType from fileType internally. sheetTitle is always "Monthly Agenda". fileName is "monthly-agenda-{yyyyMMdd}.{ext}"
- FileGenerationClient: wraps RestTemplate calls to meeting-planner and content-creator, always adds X-Internal-Service header, returns byte[]
- FileType enum: holds contentType string and file extension per type
- ExportExceptionHandler: ExportException → 400, IOException → 500, RestClientException → 503

